  m_Text: "B\u1EA1n b\xE8 nh\u1EADp c\xF9ng m\xE3 ph\xF2ng \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u01A1i chung (t\u1ED1i \u0111a 4 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi).\nB\xE0n ph\xEDm: WASD di chuy\u1EC3n \xB7 J \u0111\xE1nh \xB7 K, L skill \xB7 Q \u0111\u1ED5i m\u1EB7t n\u1EA1 \xB7 U tuy\u1EC7t k\u1EF9 \xB7 Space l\u01B0\u1EDBt \xB7 1, 2, 3 ping"
